gy”\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t- That she had been shown by a professor in a college class about religions\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t- And then I have to wonder how the college class about religions came about \\- is that an interest of hers, was it just an assigned class, or what?\n\t\t\t\t- Also earlier I casually dropped a Shrek the Musical reference because I know Sam seems to like showtunes\/theater\/etc I think, and I wondered if she’d know about it\n\t\t\t\t\t- *And she did*\n\t\t\t\t- Oh, we also touched on Alex Baldwin and guns on movie sets\n\t\t\t\t\t- Which resulted in the “why do they need real guns?”\n\t\t\t\t\t- Which I get the instinct, but got to say my line, which is:\n\t\t\t\t\t- This, or something like it, has happened exactly 2 other times in the history of cinema\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- Once, with Brandon Lee\n\t\t\t\t\t\t- And then there was some reality TV guy who played Russian Roulette with a blank and accidentally killed himself\n- After work\n\t- Dinner\n\t\t- They had tacos, I had nuggets and fries, mom seemed unwilling to believe that I’d grown up eating tacos\\. Like\\. She’s talking about maybe I should try a taco\\.\\.\\. I’ve eaten a lot of tacos, mom\\.\n\t\t- Mom’s getting cataract surgery in May\\. Will severely improve her vision\\. Sounds like I’ll be driving her to the appointment\n\t\t- My birthday falls on a weird time theater\\-wise, so there was some brief discussion of when would be best to go out to eat\n\t\t\t- Wait, where was Leo during my last\\.\\.\\. oh right\\! Disney\\.\n\t\t- And we talked about the Bruce Campbell event dad sent me info about yesterday\n\t\t\t- At first, he was like, he can’t go because of some theater stuff\n\t\t\t- But we all talked about it more and they think he can weasel out of that\n\t\t\t- \\(And mom kept tying it back to my birthday, but, like, I wouldn’t want to go without dad, right? Wouldn’t want to do that to him\\.\\)\n\t\t\t- Anyway\\. It sounds like it’s a plan\\. It’s in early April, I’ll pick dad up from VOH